# POSIP menu audit

## Cara audit (wajib dalam)

Per menu AppMenu (urutan Home → …): trace FE view + API + Action/Model + permission seeder + cross-modul + query DB. Cek: bisnis, kode, keamanan, cross-menu, UI (PrimeVue/Sakai dulu), DRY, anti-N+1/index.

## Output

- File: `docs/quality/audits/NN-slug.md` (header CONVENTIONS)
- Jangan “fix saja” tanpa bukti path/baris
- Fix kode hanya jika user minta; audit default = temuan + antrian

